  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 30446960640
    m_Localized: To win, one must know both the enemy and oneself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30451154944
    m_Localized: So after every battle, I have prepared a separate analysis.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30451154945
    m_Localized: Here is the Codex. I will keep recording information on our troops
      and the enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30451154946
    m_Localized: Check it whenever a notice appears. A closer look may reveal a better
      strategy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
